# public/data/{manifest.json,fields.bin} ARE tracked, unlike every other build
# product in this repository. They are 2.4 MB together, and tracking them is
# what lets someone clone and `npm run dev` without also having the 163 MB zarr
# store and the checkpoints the exporter reads. The rule they are exempt from
# exists for 573 MB of checkpoints and 1.8 GB of rasters, not for this.
